        text: 'Secondary-source lead, not a finding: ' + String(_ld.evidence || '').replace(/\s*\[secondary source on p\.[^\]]*\]/g, '').replace(/\s*\[OCR page: weight reduced[^\]]*\]/g, '').replace(/\s+/g, ' ').trim() + ' — verify against the primary record' });
    }
